00:05:15,789 --> 00:05:21,789
How do you get even with a womanizer? Make him a woman!

2
00:10:31,578 --> 00:10:37,578
Sam is a comedy, fantasy, romance film directed by Nicholas Brooks.

3
00:15:47,368 --> 00:15:53,368
The journey of young, handsome New York City playboy Sam Wellman - man’s man and
professional woman hater – and his relationship with Doc, his best (and only!) friend.

4
00:21:03,157 --> 00:21:09,157
One strange, drunken night Sam stumbles into an Old Curiosity Shop, where the elderly proprietor
offers him tea along with sage advice on treasuring “the female of the species”.

5
00:26:18,947 --> 00:26:24,947
Sam awakens the next morning to find himself transformed into a woman.

