01:03:09,473 --> 01:03:15,473
Sam Esmail (born September 17, 1977) is an American film and television producer,
director, and screenwriter who runs the production company Esmail Corp.

13
01:08:25,263 --> 01:08:31,263
He is best known as the creator, writer, and director of the
award-winning USA Network television series Mr.

14
01:13:41,052 --> 01:13:47,052
Robot (2015–2019), starring Rami Malek.

15
01:18:56,842 --> 01:19:02,842
He wrote and directed the feature films Comet (2014)
and Leave the World Behind (2023).

16
01:24:12,631 --> 01:24:18,631
He produced and directed the first season of the acclaimed Amazon Prime Video psychological thriller Homecoming (2018–2020), starring Julia Roberts
and Janelle Monáe, and produced USA's Briarpatch (2020), Starz's Gaslit (2022), and Peacock's Angelyne (2022) and The Resort (2022).

17
01:29:28,421 --> 01:29:34,421
Esmail's work often centers on the themes of
alienation, technology, and American society.

18
01:34:44,210 --> 01:34:50,210
The tone is lighthearted and emotional.
